# Unpublished research writing stays off the remote entirely.
# docs/ holds the training protocol and the draft Methods section;
# manuals/ holds the rendered PDFs of the same documents.
# Note: a .gitignore only stops FUTURE tracking -- it does not remove
# anything already committed. See the repo history purge, 2026-08-17.
docs/
manuals/

# ...but keep the project docs that ship with the repo
!medpc/*.md
!README.md
